    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/5/45242.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 45,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, there is a lot of negativity in politics, and unfortunately the Trump era has not helped heal the country. In fact, it's further divided the country, and that's really unfortunate. I don't know how we get past it, because I see dangerous cracks in the foundations of our democracy and government, and undermining the Constitution. So I'm troubled by that and I'm hoping that the pendulum does swing the other way and we can get back to regular order or just get some back to normalcy. But we've got a lot of work to do, but we've got to try to work harder to find that center and bring everybody in the country together.",
