    "turn_idx": 46,
    "turn_text": "Well, I think that people who are Democrats seem to want to get that done. It's very disheartening when there's really good legislation, and I want to get into that, that you helped pass and write, et cetera, that people who don't vote for go and take credit for it. I mean, not fair.",
